#set par(first-line-indent: 0pt)

This book was made from recorded conversations between Ruth Calder and Sam Calder. The recordings were transcribed word for word, and every passage in the book was checked against them. Every fact in the narrative comes from what she said, and every quotation is in her own words, with only filler words and false starts removed.

